### Get Profile
GET {{host}}/api/v1/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}


### Update Profile
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Ahmad"
}

# support webp, jpeg, png
### Update Profile Picture webp
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/user/profile/profile-picture
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profile-picture"; filename="path-file.webp"
Content-Type: image/webp

< path/to/your/file.webp
--boundary--
